  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accelerating decent jobs and social protection for a just transition to formality in Uzbekistan - 01003802</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to reduce informal employment, by formalising enterprises and jobs, expanding social insurance to informal and migrant workers, and piloting integrated approaches between employment and social protection. Expected results include increased income security, decreased decent work deficit, and increased government revenues, thereby improving the quality and sustainability of essential public services in particular social protection for the most vulnerable and employment promotion.</narrative>
  </description>
